#edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3e19c705-cd14-5edd-9733-28f10e7bbc9e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186237890 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's denote the vectors of $B$ as ${q}_{1},\\,{q}_{2}.$ \n\nSince $B$ is an orthogonal basis, we have that $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]$, where ${x}_{i}=\\frac{x\\cdot {q}_{i}}{{q}_{i}\\cdot {q}_{i}}.$ Computing ${x}_{1},$ we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =\\frac{x\\cdot {q}_{1}}{{q}_{1}\\cdot {q}_{1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-9)\\cdot 4+8\\cdot 2}{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-36+16}{16+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{-20}{20} \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n6{x}_{1}=6\\cdot (-1)=-6.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324038 #edb/ref 1080 "-4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324038 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324038 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0762d58d-9e79-5b37-bd48-01966dae21f2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324075 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324075 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324075 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0b7aaa80-e01e-5a58-acbc-d5e2cf0c471a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324157 #edb/ref 1080 "7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324157 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324157 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "147f8ee5-d8ce-58c8-8ec7-1f709eba5719" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324671 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{11}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324671 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324671 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5451e40e-c98f-5121-858d-ceb7dac87ed7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324684 #edb/ref 1080 "-13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324684 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324684 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "55bb3ad9-903d-5981-9bed-126a70f4d30a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324950 #edb/ref 1080 "-7" #edb/re